{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Carol — the mayor hiding something\n\nMother of Dess and Noelle, Rudy's wife. Investigates the south side of town and keeps a black katana in her own bedroom.","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Is she the mystery caller?**\nAppears right after Kris's secret call — but her voice on the Rare Route doesn't match the voice from that call.","x":346,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Dess and Noelle**\nUnresolved grief over Dess; suffocating control and constant pressure on Noelle.","x":164,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Rudy**\nThey met when he told her she was 'a piece of woman who BURNED' — she knocked him out with a slap.","x":-424,"y":294,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nHer tenant and possible research collaborator — they share an almost identical document corkboard.","x":-606,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Does she know about the Angel (player)?**\nThe mystery call emphasizes 'YOU' in red, as if she knew someone was controlling Kris from outside.","x":900,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_call_weird_route.webp","x":711,"y":-341,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_welcoming_kriss_and_YOU.png","x":418,"y":561,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_and_Rudy_room.png","x":-668,"y":571,"width":252,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_y_Carol_corcho.webp","x":-961,"y":-347,"width":260,"height":182},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_welcoming_kriss_and_YOU.png","x":1285,"y":-87,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_Holiday.webp","x":-79,"y":-436,"width":178,"height":387},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Is she the Roaring Knight?**\nAntlers and a black katana similar to the Black Knife — but she's home when the Knight attacks the church.","x":-450,"y":-730,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_face_ominous_unused.png","x":-449,"y":-1120,"width":190,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"}]}